{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16856","headline":"享惠昭太子庙乐章 · 归登","name":"享惠昭太子庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉荐既陈，祀事孔明。\n间歌在堂，万舞在庭。\n外则尽物，内则尽诚。\n凤笙如闻，歆其洁精。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}